        <h1>Data Deletion Request</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated: May 2026</p>

        <p>
            VLCG HRMS is used by authorized company administrators, HR users, managers,
            and employees. This page explains how users can request deletion of their data.
        </p>

        <div class="note">
            This page applies to VLCG HRMS user data connected with employee accounts,
            attendance, leave, payroll, documents, and HRMS activity.
        </div>

        <h2>1. How to Request Data Deletion</h2>
        <p>
            To request deletion of your VLCG HRMS data, please contact the company administrator
            or send an email request using the details below.
        </p>

        <ol>
            <li>Send an email to <strong>harikpalem@gmail.com</strong>.</li>
            <li>Use the subject line: <strong>VLCG HRMS Data Deletion Request</strong>.</li>
            <li>Include your name, employee ID if available, registered phone number or email address, and reason for deletion.</li>
            <li>The HR/Admin team will verify your identity and review the request.</li>
            <li>After verification, eligible data will be deleted or anonymized as per company policy and legal requirements.</li>
        </ol>

        <h2>2. Data That May Be Deleted</h2>
        <p>Depending on the request and company policy, the following data may be deleted or anonymized:</p>

        <ul>
            <li>Employee profile information.</li>
            <li>Employee profile photo.</li>
            <li>Attendance photo proof, where legally allowed.</li>
            <li>Uploaded employee documents, where legally allowed.</li>
            <li>Employee notification records.</li>
            <li>Inactive login account details.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Data That May Be Retained</h2>
        <p>
            Some records may need to be retained for legal, payroll, tax, accounting, audit,
            employment, or company compliance purposes.
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>Payroll and salary records.</li>
            <li>Attendance records required for HR/payroll compliance.</li>
            <li>Leave and attendance regularization records.</li>
            <li>Activity logs required for security and audit purposes.</li>
            <li>Records required by law, company policy, tax, or accounting requirements.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="warning">
            Some data may not be deleted immediately if retention is required for legal,
            payroll, accounting, audit, or company compliance reasons.
        </div>

        <h2>4. Processing Time</h2>
        <p>
            Data deletion requests are reviewed after identity verification. Processing time may vary
            depending on the type of data and applicable company or legal requirements.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Contact</h2>
        <p>
            For data deletion or privacy-related requests, contact:
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong>Email:</strong> harikpalem@gmail.com<br>
            <strong>Website:</strong> https://vlcghrms.in
        </p>

